    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even when i make it \"manageable,\" it just feels like i'm delaying the inevitable. like i'm just sitting in a waiting room for something that's already decided. if it's actually just my biology, then all this effort to stay \"stable\" feels like a joke. why am i even trying to fight something that's literally part of my makeup?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
